# CI/CD Workflow Definitions — GitHub Actions

This directory contains GitHub Actions workflow definitions for the `{{ .input_project_name }}` AgentOps project. Workflows cover unit and integration testing, bundle validation, and multi-environment deployment of Databricks resources (jobs, apps, MLflow artifacts).

For full setup instructions see the [AgentOps Setup Guide](../../docs/agentops-setup.md). Ensure the `WORKFLOW_TOKEN` secret has **Read and write** workflow permissions (Repo Settings → Actions → General).

## Workflow Summary

| File | Trigger | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| `{{ .input_project_name }}-bundle-ci.yml` | PR to any branch | Validates `staging` + `prod` bundles; posts results as PR comments |
| `{{ .input_project_name }}-run-tests.yml` | PR to any branch | Unit tests + integration test (deploys `test` target to staging workspace) |
| `{{ .input_project_name }}-bundle-cd-staging.yml` | Push to `{{ .input_default_branch }}` | Validates and deploys `staging` target to staging workspace |
| `{{ .input_project_name }}-bundle-cd-prod.yml` | Push to `{{ .input_release_branch }}` | Validates and deploys `prod` target to production workspace |
| `deploy-cicd.yml` | Manual (`workflow_dispatch`) | Generates per-project workflow files for a given `project_name` |
| `lint-cicd-workflow-files.yml` | PR touching `.github/workflows/` | Lints workflow YAML files with `actionlint` |

## Required Secrets

Add these secrets to your GitHub repository (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions):

{{ if (eq .input_cloud `azure`) -}}
| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `STAGING_AZURE_SP_TENANT_ID` | Staging service principal tenant ID |
| `STAGING_AZURE_SP_APPLICATION_ID` | Staging service principal application (client) ID |
| `STAGING_AZURE_SP_CLIENT_SECRET` | Staging service principal client secret |
| `PROD_AZURE_SP_TENANT_ID` | Production service principal tenant ID |
| `PROD_AZURE_SP_APPLICATION_ID` | Production service principal application (client) ID |
| `PROD_AZURE_SP_CLIENT_SECRET` | Production service principal client secret |
| `WORKFLOW_TOKEN` | GitHub PAT with `workflow` scope (required by `deploy-cicd.yml`) |
{{- else -}}
| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `STAGING_WORKSPACE_TOKEN` | Service principal PAT for the staging workspace |
| `PROD_WORKSPACE_TOKEN` | Service principal PAT for the production workspace |
| `WORKFLOW_TOKEN` | GitHub PAT with `workflow` scope (required by `deploy-cicd.yml`) |
{{- end }}

## Branch → Environment Mapping

| Branch | Environment | Workspace |
|--------|-------------|-----------|
| Any PR | `test` (CI integration test) | Staging workspace |
| `{{ .input_default_branch }}` | `staging` | Staging workspace |
| `{{ .input_release_branch }}` | `prod` | Production workspace |
